<title>THAILAND: Thai money markets closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Thai money markets closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's money markets were closed on Tuesday for a public holiday on New Year's Eve.</p>
<p>The overnight interbank rate finished at 14.00-14.50 percent on Monday, while the baht firmed to 25.630-25.640 to the dollar in quiet dealings.</p>
<p>The money markets will be closed on New Year's Day and will reopen on Thursday, January 2.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
